{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39540","headline":"喜友人日南回 · 张蠙","name":"喜友人日南回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南游曾去海南涯，此去游人不易归。\n白日雾昏张夜烛，穷冬气暖着春衣。\n溪荒毒鸟随船啅，洞黑冤蛇出树飞。\n重入帝城何[寂]寞，共回迁客半轻肥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}